{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>BRAINKILLED\u00a0</u></strong>is a puzzle/riddle game for people who like hard puzzles, those who love to challenge their brains and escape room lovers. It includes 2 games:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <strong><u>MAIN PUZZLE GAME</u></strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <u><strong>ADVANCED MATH PUZZLE GAME</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In both games you will need  <strong><u>logic, observation, memory and interaction with the elements</u></strong> of the level. Furthermore, concerning the math game,  advanced math knowledge is needed as well. Some levels will require further searching. On each level, you have to <strong><u>find the password</u></strong> in order to procceed to the next one. <u><strong>Padlocks</strong></u> will inform you about the form of the password (letters, numbers ect)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are <strong><u>hidden levels</u></strong>\u00a0and <u><strong>secret riddles\u00a0</strong></u>that need to be discovered and thus <u><strong>achievements</strong></u> awaiting for you to unlock! Thinking out of the box can help you towards this goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Have you seen the trailer of the game?\u00a0</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You might need to take a second look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505350?t=1744310339","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505350/65518f701249f04b74ef15909136cacdcbcefdbf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744310339","